on" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-107567" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2"] ["math" "-2+\\text{i}"] ["math" "-2\\text{i}"] ["math" "1-\\text{i}"] ["math" "2\\text{i}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-107567" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $z=8(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}))$ in the form $z=x+y\\,\\text{i},$ where $x$ and $y$ are real numbers. Give the **exact** values of $x$ and $y.$\n\n$z=$\n{{field-1}}\n$-$\n{{field-2}}\n$i$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To express the number in Cartesian form, we expand the parentheses and substitute the values of the cosine and sine.\n\nFirst, we find $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})$ and $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute the values and expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =8(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =8(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\text{i}\\,(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})) \\\\  & =-\\frac{8\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\text{i}\\,\\frac{8\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =-4\\sqrt{2}-4\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3c1bf3d8a1d050d44d7529fa9ef3fa3b7f33f7d0f3396b3a91a9918da48ba822"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-4\\sqrt{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file_sha256" "1508a11256c88c65d841c696945663f7f1cdf4e5b1de2b7f6f358486951340a2"} {"question" "q-324344" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978069/state.json" "file